00:06:41.470 --> 00:06:45.830
The only thing they do is they take out
PHP 7.4, and they say good luck.

00:06:45.830 --> 00:06:48.150
And everything else is up to the customer.

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:50.870
And that's why they have one-dollar
